<title>SINGAPORE: Pidemco awards Sato Kogyo S$68 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Pidemco awards Sato Kogyo S$68 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Pidemco Land has awarded a Singapore $68 million contract to Sato Kogyo Co Ltd, Pidemco said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>A Pidemco Land statement said the contract is for its S$380 million Cuppage Centre redevelopment project.</p>
<p>Sato Kogyo is the main contractor for the project. Work has already started and the project is expected to be completed by mid-1998.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
